WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:31.500
"Perish, foul creatures!"

00:01:01.960 --> 00:01:07.920
"I am Siegmeyer of Catarina, and you shall feel my wrath!"

00:01:13.500 --> 00:01:16.420
When an undead loses all hope, they begin to hollow.

00:01:16.960 --> 00:01:20.000
Siegmeyer is an adventurer, who prides himself on his bravery.

00:01:20.220 --> 00:01:23.760
His ability to progress and expore is what keeps him from hollowing.

00:01:24.160 --> 00:01:26.000
The name Siegmeyer means victory.

00:01:26.240 --> 00:01:28.980
Succes is the core of who he is.

00:01:29.320 --> 00:01:32.400
"Adventuring is my life. I'm prepared for the worst.

00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:34.900
Hah hah hah hah!"

00:01:35.500 --> 00:01:39.660
With good intentions the Chosen Undead saves Siegmeyer time and time again.

00:01:39.980 --> 00:01:43.560
The man learns, that he only has to wait for his problems to be solved.

00:01:43.980 --> 00:01:47.840
So, in helping Siegmeyer, you take everything from him.

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:52.640
And an undead who loses everything, becomes hollow.

00:01:52.680 --> 00:01:56.700
"I have run flat up against a wall. Or, a gate, I should say.

00:01:56.700 --> 00:02:00.260
The thing just won't budge. No matter how long I wait.

00:02:00.260 --> 00:02:03.160
And, oh, have I waited!"

00:02:05.320 --> 00:02:10.400
"This is quite a fix… We'll need another three, no, maybe five bodies…

00:02:10.400 --> 00:02:13.580
Hmm.. quite a fix indeed…"

00:02:15.480 --> 00:02:19.020
"Umm... by my knighthood, I am ashamed to ask…

00:02:19.060 --> 00:02:21.560
But can you spare a few scraps of moss?"

00:02:22.260 --> 00:02:25.400
As you save Siegmeyer, you are draining his believe in himself.

00:02:25.660 --> 00:02:28.620
Everytime you help him, he becomes more and more hollow.

00:02:29.260 --> 00:02:32.080
That is until he desides to make a final stand.

00:02:32.320 --> 00:02:34.920
He sacrifices himself to repay his friend.

00:02:35.240 --> 00:02:38.120
But you take that victory from him... as well.

00:02:56.240 --> 00:03:00.500
"And now, I go! Don't be slow!"

00:03:06.580 --> 00:03:10.260
"C'mon! Over here, you fiends!

00:03:10.260 --> 00:03:13.060
Perish, foul creatures!

00:03:13.120 --> 00:03:19.900
I am Siegmeyer of Catarina, and you shall feel my wrath!"

00:03:21.240 --> 00:03:26.820
If you allow Siegmeyer to sacrifice himself while you escape, than he will die with his honour intact.

00:03:28.860 --> 00:03:34.720
However, the only way of him to survive is if you shame him and save his life... again.

00:03:38.160 --> 00:03:41.360
"But, you! Didn't you get away?

00:03:41.360 --> 00:03:46.720
Well, you've saved me, once again… Oh, thank goodness…

00:03:46.900 --> 00:03:48.620
I'm exhausted."

00:03:49.280 --> 00:03:52.400
This is the last time you will see Siegmeyer... alive.

00:03:55.320 --> 00:03:58.120
"Oh! Have you seen my father?

00:03:58.220 --> 00:04:01.780
You wouldn't miss him. A suit of armour, just like mine."

00:04:03.240 --> 00:04:05.520
Sieglinde is the daughter of Siegmeyer.

00:04:05.560 --> 00:04:10.180
She risks the perils of Lordran to tell her father his wife's dying words.

00:04:11.120 --> 00:04:16.760
"My daughter risk life and limb, just to find me... to deliver her mothers last words.

00:04:17.440 --> 00:04:21.040
And the poor girl's not even undead. Sigh... heavens...

00:04:21.740 --> 00:04:23.920
...I never asked her to do that."

00:04:24.880 --> 00:04:29.200
It would seem that Siegmeyer abandoned his daughter and wife for a life of adventuring.

00:04:29.640 --> 00:04:32.960
It is clear that Siegmeyer cares for his daughter and her for him.

00:04:33.240 --> 00:04:36.820
But something has happened in their past to let them being kept apart.

00:04:38.600 --> 00:04:42.960
After hearing his wife's dying words from the daughter who risked her life,

00:04:42.960 --> 00:04:46.100
he goes on his final reckless adventure.

00:04:49.720 --> 00:04:55.960
Hollowing is a slow process with the undead suffering many deaths before they hollow to a point of no return.

00:04:56.280 --> 00:04:59.380
The name Sieglinde means gentle battle.

00:05:00.160 --> 00:05:04.240
I believe Sieglinde has killed her father before, but only out of necessity.

00:05:06.020 --> 00:05:10.700
"If he goes Hollow, I'll just have to kill him again."

00:05:17.860 --> 00:05:21.960
Siegmeyer hollows completely at the end of his adventure.

00:05:23.460 --> 00:05:27.640
"Yes, now I see. You are one of the bad ones.

00:05:28.460 --> 00:05:31.280
Then, there's only one thing to do with you."

00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:59.400
"Oh, how can this be… dear father…"

00:05:59.480 --> 00:06:04.860
"Heavens, me… my dear little Lin…"

00:06:17.280 --> 00:06:21.660
And so, your friend Siegmeyer meets his end in Ash Lake.

00:06:22.320 --> 00:06:25.160
And there is nothing you can do to stop him.

00:06:29.620 --> 00:06:33.040
"My father…all Hollow now…

00:06:33.700 --> 00:06:35.540
...has been subdued.

00:06:36.480 --> 00:06:40.100
He will cause no more trouble. It's finally over…

00:06:41.360 --> 00:06:43.180
Oh, father…

00:06:44.800 --> 00:06:46.680
...dear father…

00:06:53.180 --> 00:06:55.820
Dear father…"

